Evelyn taps at her smart watch, trying to get it to come alive. The screen flicks a couple of times, befoire going black. She sighs, frustrated. 
->"What a piece of garbage"
        She unlatches the watch from her wrist, sliding it back into her pocket. She explores further, but hears a sharp popping noise as she walks away. She ignores it and continues moving.
->"Can't run your way out of this"
        She unlatches the watch from her wrist, sliding it back into her pocket. She begins explores further, but hears a sharp popping noise as she walks away. She ignores it and continues moving.
->"Worth a shot"
        She unlatches the watch from her wrist, sliding it back into her pocket. She explores further, but hears a sharp popping noise as she walks away. She ignores it and continues moving.
->"No one can reach you here"
        <<add_fear "Evelyn Ventress">>
        //Fear of Isolation
        She stops for a second, thinks to herself, and looks down at the watch. Frantically, she starts to shake her wrist with her other hand, hoping that she can will it back to life. Suddenly, it begins glowing a bright blue light. Evelyn covers her eyes. Just as she begins to reopen them, the screen goes dark and smoke emanates from the watch. She throws it to the floor and keeps on walking. 
